{
 "id": "T11-RELEASED-FIXTURE-AUDIT",
 "spec": "SPEC-LIVE-SET-STRUCTURE revision 1 (A1, A2, A3 settled statically; A5 still an assumption)",
 "method": "Audit every released fixture against the structural load rules of SPEC-LIVE-SET-STRUCTURE r1.\n\nUsage: python3 -I fixture_audit.py <schema.txt> <handoff dir> <out.json>\nRead-only on handoff/. For each release, each fixture file is classified (Live Set, device preset,\ndeliberately unparseable, or not a Live Set document) and linked to the cases that use it with their\nexpectations. For a Live Set, the traced refusals are evaluated:\n  REQ-002  no audio, MIDI or group track; a player track after a return track     (validation walk)\n  REQ-006  an audio or MIDI track whose freeze slot count differs from its session slot count (walk)\n  REQ-013  a mixer with more send holders than trailing return tracks              (root post-load)\n  REQ-015  a pointee present with Id 0 or without Id; NextPointeeId not above the largest pointee Id\n  REQ-016  a negative or duplicate list-item Id (S-cond A5)\nand two shapes with no load check (REQ-006 slots != scenes, REQ-013 SendsPre != returns) are noted.\nFor a fixture that would be refused, the minimal addition taken from T11-MIN's skeleton is recorded\nas XML text with its insertion point, applied to a copy, and the copy is re-checked. The addition\nonly adds elements; no existing element or value changes, so what the case tests is kept.\nEnvelope, value-text and field-level refusals belong to the other specs and are not evaluated.",
 "basis": {
  "REQ-002, REQ-006": "validation walk, run by the XML reader's load step on every open (A1 settled)",
  "REQ-006 freeze count": "the freeze sequencer is constructed with an empty slot list and no load step adds slots (A2 settled)",
  "REQ-013, REQ-015 NextPointeeId": "root post-load step, enabled by the reading context's flag, which the XML reader's context sets (A1 settled)",
  "REQ-015 Id 0": "member post-load step; preset exemption not set on the set-open path (A3 settled)",
  "REQ-016": "generic list loader (S-cond A5)"
 },
 "totals": {
  "fixtures": 32,
  "live_sets": 31,
  "refused": 13,
  "cases_contradicted": 0,
  "cases_not_isolating": 13
 },
